C-N2: Dropdown menu  (implement if dropdown arrows visible in screenshots)
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
HTML structure required:
  <li class="has-dropdown">
    <button
      aria-expanded="false"
      aria-haspopup="true"
      aria-controls="dropdown-[id]">
      [Label] <span aria-hidden="true">&#9660;</span>
    </button>
    <ul id="dropdown-[id]" role="list" hidden>
      <li><a href="...">Item</a></li>
    </ul>
  </li>

JS behavior:
  - Click button: toggle aria-expanded + hidden on menu
  - Escape: close menu, return focus to button
  - Click outside: close all open dropdowns
  - ArrowDown from button: move focus to first menu item
  - ArrowDown/Up within menu: cycle through items
  - Tab from last item: close menu naturally

