C-D2: Tab panel  (implement if tab bar visible in screenshots)
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
HTML structure required:
  <div role="tablist" aria-label="[Section label]">
    <button role="tab" aria-selected="true"  aria-controls="panel-1" id="tab-1" tabindex="0">Tab 1</button>
    <button role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-2" id="tab-2" tabindex="-1">Tab 2</button>
  </div>
  <div role="tabpanel" id="panel-1" aria-labelledby="tab-1">...</div>
  <div role="tabpanel" id="panel-2" aria-labelledby="tab-2" hidden>...</div>

JS behavior:
  - Click tab: set aria-selected=true on clicked, false on others,
               show associated panel, hide others,
               set tabindex=0 on active tab, -1 on all others
  - ArrowRight/Left: move focus between tabs (roving tabindex pattern)
  - Home/End: jump to first/last tab

